# Meridian

Read `design.md` before writing UI. This repo showcases a **theme for AIs**, not a custom component zoo.

## Hard rules

- Tokens only; one accent `--brand`; status stays semantic (`destructive` / `warning`)
- Primitives from shadcn (`components/ui/`) — `npx shadcn@latest add`; never fork a parallel kit
- Surfaces via `data-surface`: `application` (default) | `marketing` | `mobile` | `desktop`
- Compose wholes (`components/surfaces/`); prove on `/theme` and `/surfaces`
- Mono for data; hierarchy from size + tracking; `edge` before shadows
- AI UI is object-bound (provenance + `activity-*`); no chatbot cliché
- No other brand names in UI chrome; cinema styling without scroll spectacle
- Hero height: `min-h-svh` never `dvh`; demo shells avoid nested `overflow-auto`

## Skills

Use when relevant: `meridian-theme`, `meridian-surface`, `meridian-compose`.
